OL,3,GNEWSA'No risk' after bomb squad called
OL,4,Aand premises evacuated in Larkhall
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say there is no risk to the
OL,7,Fpublic after a bomb disposal team
OL,8,Fexamined a "possible historic ordnance"
OL,9,Fin Larkhall.
OL,11,FStreets were closed off and local
OL,12,Fpremises evacuated after the discovery
OL,13,Fon Broomhill Road just after 09:00.
OL,15,FOfficers said the object had been
OL,16,Fidentified and the police presence was
OL,17,Fbeing stood down.
OL,19,FLarkhall Leisure Centre was evacuated,
OL,20,Fand both Broomhill Road and Broomhill
OL,21,FDrive were closed during the incident.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
